---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title="About" description="A little about Naman Patel and what he spends his time on.">
  <div class="quiet-page">
    <header class="quiet-page-header"><h1>About me</h1><p>I’m Naman. I write, build things on the internet, read manga, and play games.</p></header>
    <div class="about-story">
      <p>I started writing on the internet before I knew how websites worked. That led me through blogging, SEO, WordPress, and eventually into building websites and apps myself.</p>
      <p>I like simple tools, quiet websites, design, illustration, games, and trying new software just to see how it works. I can spend a surprising amount of time fixing a detail that nobody asked me to fix.</p>
      <p>I’m also writing a fantasy novel. It is a very large story, so I expect to be working on it for a long time. I read manga and watch <em>One Piece</em> when I’m not writing it.</p>
      <p>This site does not have one strict subject. Sometimes I write about software or the internet. Sometimes I write about something I noticed and did not want to forget.</p>
      <p>You can read my <a href={`${base}archive/`}>notes</a>, see some <a href={`${base}projects/`}>projects</a>, or look through my <a href={`${base}experience/`}>experience</a>. I’m also on <a href="https://github.com/namanlabc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> and <a href="https://x.com/namanlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
